      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine reconciliation by Codex, reused non-author of both current originals. Springtime and wintertime are established whole seasonal terms, without subword members. Each co-acting modifier owns contributing inside its own contributing-factor compound. The two complete la brten nas dependence phrases own Based on; covered nas is not separately nulled. Four active agentives have no separate English exponent. Each byas pa owns the second or fourth provides; first and third provides are reprises of the shared predicates. Four reg bya occurrences and the two body/consciousness member groups retain their distinct owners. Nominal experience syntax, anaphoric spirit subjects, rays/body expansions and the closing causal framing remain distributed and unwrapped. C15/C18 omit of before cold; C05 preserves it. No source wording or hgm_gloss is changed."
